This project is a test automation framework built using **Playwright**, **TypeScript**, and **Cucumber (Gherkin)**. 

## Tech Stack

- [Playwright](https://playwright.dev) – Modern browser automation framework
- [TypeScript](https://www.typescriptlang.org/) – Typed JavaScript for better code quality
- [Cucumber.js](https://github.com/cucumber/cucumber-js) – BDD-style Gherkin syntax
- [ts-node](https://github.com/TypeStrong/ts-node) – Run TypeScript directly
- [multiple-cucumber-html-reporter](https://github.com/wswebcreation/multiple-cucumber-html-reporter) – Pretty HTML test reports

## Project Structure

project-root/
│
├── src/
│    └──main/   
│    │   └──code      
│    │      ├──page-objects              
│    │      │    ├──BBC.ts                 # classes to interact with BBC Sports Result Page
│    │      │    ├──RegisterPage.ts        # classes to interact with Register Pop up Page
│	 │		│	 └──SearchPage.ts          # classes to interact with Search Page
│	 │	    ├──setup            
│    │      │    ├── hooks.ts              # hooks file for brower setup 
│	 │		│	 └── world.ts              # world file to define variables that can be passed in step files 
│	 │		│	
│	 │	    └──stepdefinitions           
│    │           ├── race-result.step.ts   # step definitions file to get race result for sports
│	 │			 └── search.step.ts        # step definitions file to implement search functionality
│    └── test/         
│          └── resources
│                └── features     
                       ├── RaceResult.feature   # Feature file to get race result 
					   └── Search.feature       # Feature file for search functionality
│
├── reports/                     # JSON + HTML reports. Cucumber report is generated as reports/html/index.html
│
├── cucumber.json                # Cucumber config
├── Dockerfile  
├── package.json               
├── tsconfig.json                # TypeScript config
├── reports.ts                   # HTML report generator
└── package.json

## Installation

cd your-repo-name

npm install

## Running Tests and generate cucumber report

npm run test
npm run report

## Docker 
In project-root：
docker build -t securitease_frontend  .
docker run --rm  securitease_frontend:latest


	